{"t":"Chocolate Cake","s":"chocolate-cake-c04a3","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Chocolate_Cake_d9db14.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Chocolate Cake</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Chocolate Cake\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Chocolate_Cake_d9db14.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Plants, Animal Products, Food and Drink<br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Food\">Food</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"pickupable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pickupable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"weight\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Weight</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">5.00 oz</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"stackable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Stackable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Trade Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"marketable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Marketable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1,000 - 10,000 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not bought by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not sold by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Utility Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"usable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Usable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"consumable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Consumable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"regenseconds\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Regeneration</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">132 seconds<br/><small>(11% full)</small></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.20<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 2, 2008<br/>Summer Update 2008</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20181203171710&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Chocolate_Cake_d9db14.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a chocolate cake.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 5.00 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>Yum.</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Since the Christmas Update 2008, it is valued because it is needed for a quest. You can't put a candle on it.<br/>\n</p>\n<br/><table id=\"w-toc\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"left\">\n<p><b>How to make a Chocolate Cake</b>\n</p><p>To make a <i>Cake</i>, you need...\n</p><p><a href=\"#/wiki/Flour\">Flour</a> (can be gotten by harvesting <a href=\"#/wiki/Wheat\">wheat</a> in a <a href=\"#/wiki/Millstone\">millstone</a>)<br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Milk\">Milk</a><br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Bar%20of%20Chocolate\">Bar of Chocolate</a><br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Oven\">Oven</a><br/>\n</p><p>1. Get the milk into a trough or <a href=\"#/wiki/Bucket\">bucket</a>.<br/>\n2. Use flour with milk. You will get <a href=\"#/wiki/Lump%20of%20Cake%20Dough\">cake dough</a>.<br/>\n3. Use the <a href=\"#/wiki/Lump%20of%20Cake%20Dough\">Lump of Cake Dough</a> on the <a href=\"#/wiki/Bar%20of%20Chocolate\">Bar of Chocolate</a>. You will get a <a href=\"#/wiki/Lump%20of%20Chocolate%20Dough\">Lump of Chocolate Dough</a>. <b>NB: Be careful <u>NOT</u> to try to use the <a href=\"#/wiki/Bar%20of%20Chocolate\">Bar of Chocolate</a> first, or you will eat it!</b><br/>\n</p>\n4. Use the chocolate dough with an oven. You will get your <i>Cake</i>. </td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br/>\nOne is needed for <a href=\"#/quest/the-hidden-city-of-beregar-quest\">The Hidden City of Beregar Quest</a>.<br/>\nBaking 10 of these will reward you with the Sweet Tooth achievement and half of the Piece of Cake achievement.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bar%20of%20Chocolate\">Bar of Chocolate</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bucket\">Bucket</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cake%20Keep%20Isle\">Cake Keep Isle</a></li><li>Cooking</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Flour\">Flour</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Food\">Food</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Frafnar\">Frafnar</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lump%20of%20Cake%20Dough\">Lump of Cake Dough</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lump%20of%20Chocolate%20Dough\">Lump of Chocolate Dough</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Milk\">Milk</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Millstone\">Millstone</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Oven\">Oven</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Penny\">Penny</a></li><li>Piece of Cake</li><li>Sweet Tooth</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/the-hidden-city-of-beregar-quest\">The Hidden City of Beregar Quest</a></li><li>Trough</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Wheat\">Wheat</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["the-hidden-city-of-beregar-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"the-hidden-city-of-beregar-quest","quest":"The Hidden City of Beregar Quest","step":"3-1","n":22,"title":"Fazer o Chocolate Cake","kind":"needed","coords":[]}]}}